  "circle": "<div id=\"vg-kring\">\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"bg-surface border border-line rounded-2xl p-5\">\n  <h2 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700\">In de kring</h2>\n  <p class=\"text-sm text-ink-soft mt-0.5\">\n    De kring is breder dan het bestuur: ook vaste deelnemers en de afdelingsondersteuner horen erbij, ook als ze geen lid zijn.\n  </p>\n  \n    <p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm py-6 text-center\">Nog niemand in de kring. Zoek hieronder een persoon om toe te voegen.</p>\n  \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg-surface border border-line rounded-2xl p-5 mt-4\">\n  <h2 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700\">Iemand toevoegen</h2>\n  \n  <div class=\"mt-3\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\">\n  <label for=\"vg-kring-start\" class=\"text-sm text-ink-soft whitespace-nowrap\">In de kring vanaf</label>\n  \n      <input type=\"date\" name=\"start_date\" id=\"vg-kring-start\" value=\"<today>\"\n       class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-ink focus:border-blue-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-200 focus:outline-none w-40\" >\n    \n</span>\n  </div>\n  \n  <input type=\"search\" name=\"q\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"Zoek op naam…\"\n         class=\"mt-3 w-full sm:w-80 rounded-lg border border-line px-3 py-2 text-sm\"\n         hx-get=\"/admin/vergaderingen/kring\" hx-target=\"#vg-kring-kandidaten\"\n         hx-select=\"#vg-kring-kandidaten\" hx-swap=\"outerHTML\"\n         hx-trigger=\"input changed delay:300ms\" aria-label=\"Zoek een persoon\">\n  <div id=\"vg-kring-kandidaten\">\n  \n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"bg-surface border border-line rounded-2xl p-5 mt-4\">\n  <h2 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700\">Iemand toevoegen die geen lid is</h2>\n  <p class=\"text-sm text-ink-soft mt-0.5\">Staat de persoon hierboven niet tussen de zoekresultaten? Dan is hij nog niet gekend — bijvoorbeeld de afdelingsondersteuner. Er wordt een persoon aangemaakt zonder gezin; hij komt meteen in de kring.</p>\n  <form class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\" hx-post=\"/admin/vergaderingen/kring/nieuw\"\n        hx-target=\"#vg-kring\" hx-swap=\"innerHTML\">\n    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"csrf_token\" value=\"…\">\n    \n    <input type=\"text\" name=\"first_name\" id=\"first_name\" placeholder=\"Voornaam\" required\n       class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-ink focus:border-blue-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-200 focus:outline-none w-36\" >\n    <input type=\"text\" name=\"last_name\" id=\"last_name\" placeholder=\"Achternaam\" required\n       class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-ink focus:border-blue-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-200 focus:outline-none w-40\" >\n    <input type=\"email\" name=\"person_email\" id=\"person_email\" placeholder=\"<example address>\"\n       class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-ink focus:border-blue-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-200 focus:outline-none w-56\" >\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\">\n  <label for=\"vg-kring-nieuw-start\" class=\"text-sm text-ink-soft whitespace-nowrap\">vanaf</label>\n  \n      <input type=\"date\" name=\"start_date\" id=\"vg-kring-nieuw-start\" value=\"<today>\"\n       class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-ink focus:border-blue-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-200 focus:outline-none w-40\" >\n    \n</span>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors bg-white border border-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 px-3.5 py-2 text-base min-h-11 md:px-3 md:py-1.5 md:text-sm md:min-h-0\" hx-disabled-elt=\"this\" ><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"inline-block shrink-0 \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"M12 5v14\"/></svg>Toevoegen aan de kring</button>\n  </form>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"bg-surface border border-line rounded-2xl p-5 mt-4\">\n  <h2 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700\">Ondertekening van de mails</h2>\n  <p class=\"text-sm text-ink-soft mt-0.5\">Komt onderaan de agenda- en verslagmail te staan. Je kunt de tekst per mail nog aanpassen voor je verstuurt.</p>\n  <form class=\"mt-3\" hx-post=\"/admin/vergaderingen/kring/ondertekening\"\n        hx-target=\"#vg-kring\" hx-swap=\"innerHTML\">\n    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"csrf_token\" value=\"…\">\n    <textarea name=\"signature\" id=\"vg-ondertekening\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Met vriendelijke groet,\nVoornaam, Voornaam en Voornaam\"\n          class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-ink focus:border-blue-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-200 focus:outline-none w-full sm:w-96\"\n          x-data=\"{ bodem: 0,\n              init() { this.groei(); if (this.bodem) return;\n                       const vak = this.$el, zelf = this;\n                       const ro = new ResizeObserver(function () {\n                         if (vak.offsetHeight) { ro.disconnect(); zelf.groei(); } });\n                       ro.observe(vak); },\n              meet() { this.$el.style.height = ``; this.bodem = this.$el.offsetHeight; },\n              groei() { if (!this.bodem) this.meet(); if (!this.bodem) return;\n                        this.$el.style.height = `auto`;\n                        const rand = this.$el.offsetHeight - this.$el.clientHeight;\n                        this.$el.style.height = Math.min(Math.max(this.$el.scrollHeight + rand, this.bodem), 400) + `px`; } }\"\n             x-on:input=\"groei()\" ></textarea>\n    <div class=\"mt-2\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors bg-white border border-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 px-3.5 py-2 text-base min-h-11 md:px-3 md:py-1.5 md:text-sm md:min-h-0\" hx-disabled-elt=\"this\" >Ondertekening bewaren</button></div>\n  </form>\n</div>\n</div>",
